      "associationCertaintyURI": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/association-certainty/certain",
      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p><em>I\u1e63\u1e6da\u1e2br</em>: An ancient city in Persia. It was said that the buildings and ancient monuments in\u00a0<em>I\u1e63\u1e6da\u1e2br were built by jinn,</em>\u00a0just like the buildings in the cities of\u00a0<em>Tedm\u00fcr</em> and<em> Ba\u2018albek</em>.\u00a0<em>S\u012bvebeyh-i Na\u1e25v\u012b</em> is from this city. According to the author of\u00a0<em>Tu\u1e25fe</em>, it was built by\u00a0<em>\u1e24um\u0101n\u012b bint Behmen</em>. (translated to English by the first creator of this entry.)</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
